  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed 2-storey side extension, roof extension incorporating gable roof and rear dormer and front porch by reason of size, siting and design would appear bulky and incongruous, and would represent an overly dominant, incongruous, and visually intrusive form of development, out of keeping and character with, and detrimental to, the appearance and character of the property and surrounding area.  This would be contrary to Core Strategy (2010) Policies CP30, Development Management Document (2014) Polices DMD11, DMD13, DMD14 and DMD37, London Plan (2021) Policy D4 and National Planning Policy Framework (2021).",
    "In the absence of a Groundwater Flood Risk Assessment Technical Note, the proposed scheme fails to appropriately consider and mitigate the risk of flooding from all potential sources, for a more sensitive residential use with habitable rooms in a basement. Therefore, it is considered the scheme would be unsafe over its lifetime, taking into account the impact of climate change. In view of this, the proposal is not compliant with the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF, 2021), policies SI.12 and SI.13 of the London Plan (2021), DMD 60, DMD 61, DMD 62 and DMD 63 of the Development Management Document (2014), CP21, CP28 and CP29 of the Core Strategy (2010)."
  ],
